sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Next.js UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant PG as PostgreSQL app
  participant MEM as learned_patterns
  participant KB as kb_articles pgvector
  participant T as Temporal Cluster
  participant W as Worker / Workflow
  participant A as Activity + Claude SDK
  participant M as MCP Jira SNOW Jamf Intune
  participant KBT as kb_search MCP

  User->>UI: Enter ticket id and spawn
  UI->>API: POST /instances
  API->>PG: INSERT instance Investigating
  API->>T: StartWorkflow ArloRemediationWorkflow
  API-->>UI: arlo_id e.g. ARLO-680
  T->>W: Workflow Task
  W->>T: Schedule Activity investigate
  T->>A: Activity Task investigate
  Note over A,MEM: Retrieval Phase - inject into Claude context
  A->>MEM: SELECT WHERE app_name OR platform matches ticket
  MEM-->>A: prior patterns e.g. from ARLO-675
  A->>KBT: kb_search query with optional category and top_k
  KBT->>KB: vector similarity VECTOR 1536
  KB-->>KBT: top runbook chunks
  KBT-->>A: hits for prompt grounding
  A->>M: Read-only vendor MCP via discovery_agent
  M-->>A: Ticket CHG existence assets compliance logs
  A->>PG: Persist discovery_pack artifact plus audit
  A-->>T: Evidence pack
  W->>T: Schedule Activity write_script
  T->>A: Activity Task write_script script_writer_agent
  A->>PG: Persist generated_script attempt 0
  A-->>T: script artifact
  W->>T: Schedule Activity generate_proposal
  T->>A: Activity Task generate_proposal
  A->>PG: Store proposal and hash status Awaiting Approval
  A-->>T: proposal_hash
  Note over W,T: wait_condition on Signal. Workflow Task completes and worker slot is freed. No Claude session, no MCP connection.

  loop Poll MVP
    UI->>API: GET /instances/ARLO-680 and /artifacts and /audit
    API->>PG: Read metadata proposal artifacts audit
    API-->>UI: Awaiting Approval plus Proposal Script Test Logs Audit Trail tabs
  end

  User->>UI: Approve visible proposal and audit
  UI->>API: POST approve with proposal_hash
  API->>PG: INSERT approval frozen actions
  API->>T: Signal approval_decision
  T->>W: Workflow Task replay plus Signal
  loop Policy 1460 test until exit 0 or max attempts
    W->>T: Schedule Activity execute_jamf_test
    T->>A: Activity Task jamf_ops_agent
    A->>A: PreToolUse PEP
    A->>M: jamf_upload_script jamf_policy_set_script jamf_execute_test_policy
    A->>PG: Persist test_execution_log
    alt exit_code != 0 and attempts remain
      W->>T: Schedule Activity write_script refactor
      T->>A: script_writer_agent no MCP
      A->>PG: Persist generated_script next attempt
    end
  end
  W->>T: Schedule Activity execute_approved
  T->>A: Activity Task execute_approved
  A->>A: PreToolUse PEP remaining frozen writes
  A->>M: Approved writes only
  A->>PG: Audit per action
  A-->>T: Execution results
  W->>T: Schedule Activity validate_and_close
  T->>A: Validation reads then close if approved and criteria pass
  Note over A,MEM: Persist Phase - only on Validation success
  A->>MEM: INSERT or increment success_count last_verified_at
  A->>PG: status Done and audit pattern_persist
  A-->>T: Done
  UI->>API: GET detail
  API-->>UI: Done
